  "bio": "Stephanie (Steph) Smith is a highly skilled tattoo artist renowned for her distinct styles of dotwork, black&gray, and trashpolka. Currently based in Lakewood, United States, she thrives at Ninth Life Studio in Denver, intricately crafting unique designs that give off a neon horrorlore fever dream vibe. Her dedication to the art is evident in her professionalism and the quality of the tattoos she creates.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Lakewood, Colorado, United States"
